-proposal","label":"《先主传》正文·群臣上表","text":"群臣宣称依旧典封刘备汉中王、拜大司马，以汉中、巴、蜀、广汉、犍为为国。","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o054-proposal"]},{"id":"dengzhang-a-e5778b16dd46c3d298c3","label":"裴注·华阳国志","text":"李朝为汉中王上文","evidence":["dengzhang-q-717a432bbf8367bb45e1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0059","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0074","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0075","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0367","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0051","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0076","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0046","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0057","role":"署表","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"受推","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"表文受呈者","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q"]},{"person":"dengzhang-p0028","role":"群下上先主为汉中王，其文朝所造","evidence":["dengzhang-q-717a432bbf8367bb45e1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":219,"label":"建安二十四年秋","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o048","basis":"建安二十四年秋"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o051a-q","xianzhu-q-o048","xianzhu-q-b-c3e56caa3865de7f7114"]},"source_order":[32,207,"O051a"],"order":6580},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o064a","title":"许靖诸葛亮等劝进并筹备礼仪","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o064a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"许靖、麋竺、诸葛亮等上言劝进，称与许慈、孟光建立礼仪、择日上尊号。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o064a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0059","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o064a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0021","role":"上言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o064a-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role